      "title": "Capability create/edit form on the Capabilities Browser screen",
      "summary": "Adds a New capability action, a per-row Edit action, and a shared create/edit form (name, version, nature, both JSON schemas, timeout, connector, concept) over PUT /v1/capabilities/{name}/{version}, replacing the screen's prior read-only detail panel.",
      "task": "task/capability-authoring/capability-create-edit-form"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/capability-authoring/json-textarea-editor",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/capability-authoring/json-textarea-editor.md",
      "title": "Shared JSON beautify/minify textarea control",
      "summary": "Adds a self-contained, reusable JSON-aware textarea field component that beautifies on demand, reports validity with every change, and exposes a pure minify function for submission.",
      "task": "task/capability-authoring/json-textarea-editor"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/concept-authoring/concept-create-edit-form",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/concept-authoring/concept-create-edit-form.md",
      "title": "Concept create and edit form on the Glossary screen's Concepts tab",
      "summary": "Adds a shared create/edit Dialog for a concept's name, accepts and ttl to the Glossary screen's Concepts tab, dispatching PUT /v1/glossary/concepts/{name} for both modes and invalidating the tab's own query on success.",
      "task": "task/concept-authoring/concept-create-edit-form"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/connector-configuration-authoring/connector-configuration-create-edit-form",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/connector-configuration-authoring/connector-configuration-create-edit-form.md",
      "title": "Connector Configuration create/edit screen",
      "summary": "Adds a new Connectors screen (route /connectors, reachable from the sidebar) listing every registered connector configuration by name, with a New action and per-row Edit action sharing one create/edit Dialog over PUT /v1/connectors/{connector}.",
      "task": "task/connector-configuration-authoring/connector-configuration-create-edit-form"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/connector-configuration-authoring/test-connector-debug-panel",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/connector-configuration-authoring/test-connector-debug-panel.md",
      "title": "Test-connector debug panel on the Connector Configuration editor",
      "summary": "A new Test section, rendered only in edit mode of the Connector Configuration dialog, that assembles a subject by hand through a registered capability naming the connector and shows the raw request sent and raw response received from one diagnostic POST /v1/test-connector call.",
      "task": "task/connector-configuration-authoring/test-connector-debug-panel"
    },
