      "title": "Proof for the capability create/edit form on the Capabilities Browser screen",
      "summary": "Two new spec files plus three realigned pre-existing ones and an extended error-ui-state.spec.ts prove all six of capability-create-edit-form's criteria, the new Edit-button screen shape, coverage for the four new error codes, and the implementation's own disclosed inferences.",
      "task": "task/capability-authoring/capability-create-edit-form"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/capability-authoring/json-textarea-editor",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/capability-authoring/json-textarea-editor.md",
