      "summary": "Thirteen tests against JsonTextareaField and getJsonTextareaMinifiedValue, proving all five stated criteria plus the implementation's own disclosed inferences.",
      "task": "task/capability-authoring/json-textarea-editor"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/concept-authoring/concept-create-edit-form",
